OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies attack on 25-year-old
OL,4,Aat building site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has denied stabbing a 25-year-old
OL,7,Fin the head with a screwdriver.
OL,9,FJames Denys, 36, pleaded not guilty to
OL,10,Fcausing grievous bodily harm with
OL,11,Fintent at Swindon Crown Court in
OL,12,FWiltshire earlier.
OL,14,FDenys is accused of attacking Jamie
OL,15,FChappell at Widham Gardens building
OL,16,Fsite in Purton, Swindon, on 23 July.
OL,17,FChappell's injuries were described as
OL,18,Flife-changing by Wiltshire Police.
OL,20,FDenys, from East Wichel in Swindon,
OL,21,Fdenies any wrongdoing and is due to go
OL,22,Fon trial on 11 January.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
